<div id="urduTextPath">علی اصغر (ع)/روانہ نہرِ لبن کو جو شیر خوار ہوا</div>
<p>rawana nahr-e- laban ko jo sheerqaar huwa<br />
zabaa'n dikhane pa gardan se teer paar huwa<br />
tadap ke hathou pa hazrat ke ham kanaar huwa<br />
qizaa'n huwa jo wo gul to gale ka haar huwa</p>

<p>idhar to shaah ko ye sadma-e- jigar pahoncha<br />
udhar madine se sughra ka naamabar pahoncha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>lahu me gharq khade the kamar jhuka-e- huwe<br />
pisar ki nanhi si mayyat gale lagaa-e- huwe<br />
lahu bhara huwa daaman use udhaaye huwe<br />
kafan ki fikr me qaime ko mu phira-e- huwe</p>

<p>ye haal dekh ke qaasid ki aas toot gayi<br />
huwa ye raasha ke fouran mehaar choot gayi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>utar ke naaqe se aadaab wo bajaa laaya<br />
magar hussain the behosh kuch na farmaaye<br />
wo nouha padhta huwa aur muttasil aaya<br />
nigaah-e- yaas se mu dekh kar ye chillaya</p>

<p>qaraar do mujhe main beqaraar hota hoo'n<br />
hussain jaan ke tum par nisaar hota hoo'n<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kaho baqeeya-e aulad-e- murtaza ho tum<br />
ameer-e- lashkar-e- allah-o- mustafa ho tum<br />
ghareeb-e koofa-o- mazloom-e- karbala ho tum<br />
bataao qasim-e- nashaad ke chacha ho tum</p>

<p>jawaab do pidar-e- naamuraad-e- akbar ho<br />
janab-e hazrate abbas ke baraadar ho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>behen hai aapki zainab sakina duqtar hai<br />
har awwal aapke lashkar ka hurr-e- safdar hai<br />
watan me bhi koi beti aleel-o shashdar hai<br />
huzoor ka koi nanha sa laal asghar hai</p>

<p>zohair aur habeeb aap ke musaaheb hai<br />
janab aun-o mohammed ke maamu saheb hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hussain bharke dam-e sard bole aye ghamqaar<br />
ameer koun hai main to hoon bekas-o- nachaar<br />
kaha'n hai akbar-o- qasim kahaa'n alambardaar<br />
quda ke bande the ye sab huwe quda pa nisaar</p>

<p>sipaahe zulm ne tanha samajh ke ghera hai<br />
hazarou'n tegh hai aur ek halq mera hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hataayi chehre se asghar ke khoo'n bhari chadar<br />
paseena maut ka maathe se poncha sar ta sar<br />
pukare laashey(murde) ki aankho'n pe honto'n ko rakh kar<br />
likhi hai fatima ne deedaa bosi-e asghar</p>

<p>gawah rahiyo ke faaqe se jhoomta hai hussain<br />
aur unke bhai ki aankho'n ko choomta hai hussain<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>banaaloo'n nanhi si qabr inki aye qujista siyar<br />
to le chaloo'n pisar-e- noujawa'n ke laashe par<br />
to padhiyo lasha-e- akbar pa naama-e- qaahar<br />
ye kahke ghode se utre imame jinn-o- bashar</p>

<p>zameen qabr ki khatir pasand karne lage<br />
mazaar khod ke naale baland karne lage<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>lahu se ghusl to asghar ko de chuki thi qazaa<br />
mali basoorat-e- kaafoor sheh ne khaake shifa<br />
utaara qabr me asghar ka khoo'n bhara laasha<br />
lita ke qaak pa qibla ki simt mu phe-ra</p>

<p>phir apne chand ko jab khaak me chipane lage<br />
to ya ali kaha aur haath thar tharraane lage<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye haal dekh ke qaasid ne ki madadgaari<br />
lahad me ungliyo'n se qaak daali ek baari<br />
pukari qaime ke dar se ye bano dukhiyaari<br />
ye kis ki qabr ki hoti hai ran me tayyari</p>

<p>hussain bole ke sadme naye guzarte hai<br />
tumhare hansliyaa'n waale ko dafn karte hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>giri zamee'n pa kaleja pakad ke wo nachaar<br />
pukari meri kamaai se aye zamee'n hushiyaar<br />
na murda jaaniyo hai meri jaan ye dildaar<br />
zameen me tere sadqe tere makee'n ke nisaar</p>

<p>ba zer-e- qaab meri mannatou'n ka baagh mila<br />
tujhe ye phool mila aur hum ko daagh mila<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>balaae'n door se lele ke phir kiya ye bayaa'n<br />
tumhari nanhi lahad ki mai waari asghar jaa'n<br />
andhera ghar hai na ghabraiyo ye maa qurbaa'n<br />
akele sone ki mushkil khuda kare aasaa'n</p>

<p>tumhare chahne waale gale lagaayenge<br />
mujhe yaqeen hai janaab-e ameer aayenge<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>